OL,3,GNEWSAGnomes stolen from charity
OL,4,Afundraising display
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who have been raising money
OL,7,Ffor charity with a gnome collection
OL,8,Fthey started during lockdown say about
OL,9,F30 have been stolen.
OL,11,FMick and Tanith Brooks, from Wyken,
OL,12,FCoventry, have more than 200 ornaments
OL,13,Fin their garden and the display has
OL,14,Fbecome quite a landmark in the last six
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,17,FPolice are investigating after the
OL,18,Fthefts, thought to have took place in
OL,19,Fthe early hours on Monday, and some of
OL,20,Fthe gnomes taken are about 2ft 6ins
OL,21,F(76cm) tall, while others have eyes
OL,22,Fthat light up.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
