OL,3,GNEWSAGnomes stolen from charity
OL,4,Afundraising display
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Somebody is light-fingered", Mick
OL,7,Fsaid. "They've pulled up in the night,
OL,8,FI presume it's got to be in a vehicle,
OL,9,Fcause they've taken as many, we think,
OL,10,Fas 30."
